WEBVTT

01:41.720 --> 01:42.560
Your phone.

01:43.480 --> 01:44.400
Qin Yeyun?

01:46.520 --> 01:47.600
Hello?

01:48.440 --> 01:49.560
Are you sure?

01:52.020 --> 01:53.660
- What is it?
- What does she want?

01:53.700 --> 01:55.340
Qin Yeyun asked me

01:55.380 --> 01:57.300
to help out with Yingtao and Jiang Qiaoxi.

01:59.620 --> 02:00.460
This is probably

02:01.740 --> 02:02.880
gonna be tricky.

02:06.440 --> 02:08.000
Come on, we'll go with you.

02:08.740 --> 02:11.039
If you can't handle it,
we've got your back.

02:11.080 --> 02:12.660
Aren't you gonna ask what it's about?

02:13.200 --> 02:14.860
If Yingtao and Jiang Qiaoxi need help,

02:15.640 --> 02:18.160
it's obviously got to do with his mom.
What else could it be?

02:18.200 --> 02:19.200
Nailed it.

02:19.860 --> 02:21.020
But honestly,

02:21.720 --> 02:23.720
this isn't something
you two can help with.

02:23.760 --> 02:25.700
Says who?

02:25.740 --> 02:27.000
Strength in numbers.

02:27.040 --> 02:28.420
Let's go. Stop wasting time.

02:28.460 --> 02:30.620
You're really going, Yu Qiao?

02:30.660 --> 02:31.500
Why wouldn't I?

02:32.380 --> 02:33.840
Yingtao grew up with us.

02:34.400 --> 02:36.120
Of course I'm going. Come on.

02:52.540 --> 02:53.560
Jiang Qiaoxi!

02:55.100 --> 02:58.980
JIALIN NO. 1 EXPERIMENTAL HIGH SCHOOL

02:59.020 --> 03:00.460
Hi, Auntie Liang.

03:01.000 --> 03:01.840
So

03:01.880 --> 03:03.340
Ms. He said there's something

03:03.380 --> 03:04.500
she needs to pass to Qiaoxi.

03:04.540 --> 03:06.300
Did she say what it was?

03:06.340 --> 03:07.300
Just…

03:07.820 --> 03:09.360
some study materials, I think.

03:09.960 --> 03:10.800
Materials for what?

03:11.480 --> 03:12.580
Materials for…

03:13.340 --> 03:14.480
for…

03:14.520 --> 03:16.140
the competition?

03:17.680 --> 03:19.360
- Something like that.
- Let me call and check.

03:24.940 --> 03:25.780
Hello.

03:28.260 --> 03:29.140
You must be kidding.

03:31.180 --> 03:32.020
I'm on my way.

03:33.340 --> 03:35.220
Zhang, go with him to get the materials.

03:35.260 --> 03:36.340
Then take him to the camp.

03:36.380 --> 03:37.440
Got it.

03:37.480 --> 03:38.860
Go with what I said earlier.

03:38.900 --> 03:40.240
- You're not coming with us?
- Use the…

03:41.140 --> 03:42.440
Use the ratio I mentioned.

03:43.980 --> 03:44.880
Let's go.

03:48.440 --> 03:51.700
NO LITTERING, NO YELLING

04:05.040 --> 04:07.040
Good news is, Jiang Qiaoxi's mom left.

04:09.240 --> 04:11.300
Bad news is,
she left her driver to keep watch.

04:16.800 --> 04:17.640
What…

04:20.620 --> 04:21.680
So we need a new plan.

04:27.660 --> 04:28.940
It's fine.

04:28.980 --> 04:31.260
I'll distract him.

04:31.300 --> 04:33.260
When I give the signal,
hand Jiang Qiaoxi the stuff.

04:44.940 --> 04:45.840
Jiang Qiaoxi,

04:45.880 --> 04:47.620
I thought you already left with your mom.

04:49.460 --> 04:51.180
Right. Ms. He,

04:51.220 --> 04:52.600
I think I forgot some materials.

04:52.640 --> 04:54.900
Cen Xiaoman already
packed everything for you.

04:54.940 --> 04:56.380
Really thorough.

04:56.420 --> 04:57.260
There's nothing else.

04:57.300 --> 04:59.800
That's a bit of an extreme take,
don't you think, Ms. He?

04:59.840 --> 05:01.980
Maybe something slipped through.

05:02.560 --> 05:03.880
What are you going on about?

05:03.920 --> 05:05.920
I helped Cen Xiaoman pack it all too.

05:08.180 --> 05:09.020
Qiaoxi,

05:09.800 --> 05:10.860
you have class later, right?

05:10.900 --> 05:12.160
Your mom asked me

05:12.200 --> 05:13.320
to drop you off on time.

05:14.040 --> 05:15.460
- Right.
- Cai Fangyuan,

05:16.520 --> 05:17.840
what's with the winking?

05:18.420 --> 05:19.560
Ms. He, he's just worried

05:19.600 --> 05:20.960
something got left behind.

05:21.620 --> 05:23.000
Well, if nothing is missing,

05:23.560 --> 05:25.200
- I'll head out then.
- Alright.

05:29.560 --> 05:30.400
Jiang Qiaoxi.

05:33.460 --> 05:34.420
Good luck with the competition.

05:36.940 --> 05:37.780
Thanks, Ms. He.

05:47.600 --> 05:48.860
Come on.

05:53.280 --> 05:54.120
Jiang Qiaoxi?

05:55.620 --> 05:57.140
Thought he had left with Auntie Liang.

05:58.220 --> 05:59.360
Who's that with him now?

06:02.200 --> 06:03.460
The Qunshan kids.

06:04.120 --> 06:06.040
Aren't they supposed to
eat in the canteen?

06:06.080 --> 06:06.920
What are they doing?

06:33.220 --> 06:34.060
Qiaoxi,

06:34.800 --> 06:36.400
I'm grabbing some noodles
across the street.

06:36.440 --> 06:38.540
You can wait in or out of the car.

06:38.580 --> 06:40.440
I'll be back in half an hour tops.

06:40.480 --> 06:41.320
Keep track of the time.

06:42.160 --> 06:43.000
Thanks, Uncle.

06:58.720 --> 06:59.560
Like it?

07:09.920 --> 07:10.760
Try some too.

07:11.880 --> 07:12.720
No, it's all yours.

07:14.880 --> 07:16.260
I just wanna eat with you.

07:18.920 --> 07:19.940
Then I'll have a bite.

07:34.660 --> 07:35.680
Jiang Qiaoxi,

07:37.000 --> 07:38.540
do you ever feel lonely

07:40.080 --> 07:42.540
when you're by yourself?

07:43.080 --> 07:44.220
No.

07:44.260 --> 07:45.900
Being alone doesn't make me

07:45.940 --> 07:46.800
feel lonely.

07:50.580 --> 07:51.900
Then what does?

07:51.940 --> 07:53.180
Meeting you.

07:57.660 --> 07:58.500
Me?

08:00.060 --> 08:01.200
Before I was ten,

08:02.160 --> 08:03.120
I was always alone.

08:04.660 --> 08:06.280
But I had math.
As long as I solved problems,

08:06.320 --> 08:07.500
I didn't feel it.

08:09.040 --> 08:10.360
Then I met you.

08:11.000 --> 08:12.280
Even math couldn't help

08:13.020 --> 08:14.480
with loneliness anymore.

08:19.540 --> 08:20.720
Then maybe

08:21.300 --> 08:22.920
your problems weren't hard enough.

08:24.440 --> 08:25.280
Exactly.

08:25.800 --> 08:27.360
I need one that's tougher than you

08:27.400 --> 08:28.880
to really challenge me.

08:31.420 --> 08:32.320
What do you mean?

08:43.600 --> 08:44.660
So

08:44.700 --> 08:46.160
how's everything going at school?

08:49.980 --> 08:52.120
I'm doing okay with most stuff.

08:52.160 --> 08:53.340
But

08:54.020 --> 08:54.880
physics is killing me.

08:57.660 --> 08:59.320
Why are you so good at solving problems?

09:00.740 --> 09:02.060
That's nothing.

09:02.100 --> 09:03.360
I just plug in the formulas.

09:04.200 --> 09:05.300
You're the amazing one.

09:05.340 --> 09:07.740
You don't even need formulas
to crack the hardest questions.

09:09.560 --> 09:10.760
You think I'm amazing?

09:11.580 --> 09:12.420
Hey,

09:13.320 --> 09:15.160
if I'm so amazing,
why wouldn't you look at me

09:15.200 --> 09:16.300
back in the office?

09:20.320 --> 09:21.760
You didn't look at me either.

09:23.200 --> 09:24.460
That's because…

09:28.820 --> 09:30.440
Because what?

09:31.100 --> 09:32.640
You first. Why didn't you look?

09:37.820 --> 09:38.880
Because…

09:43.260 --> 09:45.280
today you looked like a grown woman.

10:04.940 --> 10:05.940
Want some water?

10:06.620 --> 10:07.460
Nah, I'm good.

10:08.760 --> 10:10.480
Took me years

10:10.520 --> 10:12.140
and so much effort

10:13.100 --> 10:14.120
to sit down for a meal

10:14.660 --> 10:16.100
with Lin Yingtao. I'm taking my chances

10:16.140 --> 10:17.280
and eat more.

10:20.000 --> 10:21.100
We'll definitely

10:21.140 --> 10:23.000
have lots more meals
together in the future.

10:27.000 --> 10:28.340
You, me,

10:29.100 --> 10:30.400
Qin Yeyun,

10:30.440 --> 10:32.140
Yu Qiao, Du Shang and Cai Fangyuan.

10:32.180 --> 10:34.360
We'll share plenty of meals,

10:35.360 --> 10:36.720
eat our way through the whole city,

10:37.220 --> 10:39.360
through every province and every region.

10:41.360 --> 10:42.720
But I don't care about fancy food.

10:43.840 --> 10:45.260
I just want

10:45.300 --> 10:46.440
Auntie Juan's home cooking.

10:47.380 --> 10:48.680
Like when we were little.

10:52.360 --> 10:55.220
Then you better chip in for groceries
like you did back then.

10:55.260 --> 10:56.540
Deal.

10:56.580 --> 10:57.960
Let me earn it first.

11:09.460 --> 11:10.740
What is it about Lin Qile?

11:10.780 --> 11:12.020
Why would Jiang Qiaoxi sneak off

11:12.600 --> 11:13.980
to meet her in some alley?

11:14.020 --> 11:15.400
Hanging out with someone like her

11:15.440 --> 11:16.300
is ruining his future.

11:16.340 --> 11:17.420
It's not that deep.

11:18.260 --> 11:19.420
They were close

11:19.460 --> 11:20.880
when they were little.

11:20.920 --> 11:22.880
Old habit sticks.

11:24.200 --> 11:25.920
It doesn't mean anything.
I'm not bothered.

11:25.960 --> 11:27.300
Are you saying that to me

11:27.340 --> 11:28.400
or to yourself?

11:29.360 --> 11:31.280
Xiaoman, stop pretending.

11:31.320 --> 11:32.780
I have no idea

11:32.820 --> 11:34.040
what you're talking about.

11:34.080 --> 11:35.600
You know exactly what's going on.

11:35.640 --> 11:36.940
Jiang Qiaoxi treats Lin Qile

11:36.980 --> 11:38.280
differently than he treats us.

11:38.820 --> 11:39.700
So what?

11:40.320 --> 11:41.340
It's temporary.

11:42.420 --> 11:44.380
He's the best, top of the class.

11:45.240 --> 11:48.140
If I also keep being the best,
he'll figure it out.

11:49.020 --> 11:50.540
You really think this is

11:50.580 --> 11:52.000
about who is the best?

11:52.840 --> 11:54.560
You're the best. He's the best.

11:54.600 --> 11:55.800
So you are the best couple?

11:55.840 --> 11:57.180
Even if that doesn't matter,

11:57.760 --> 11:59.500
we knew Jiang Qiaoxi first.

12:00.300 --> 12:02.300
I knew Jiang Qiaoxi first!

12:02.960 --> 12:04.360
Okay, calm down.

12:04.400 --> 12:05.640
I have an idea.

12:05.680 --> 12:07.600
What if we tell Auntie Liang about this?

12:07.640 --> 12:08.860
Didn't she ask us

12:08.900 --> 12:10.420
to keep an eye on him?

12:10.460 --> 12:11.860
We're helping him find his way back.

12:13.360 --> 12:15.700
This is my business. I'll handle it.

12:17.240 --> 12:18.360
No need to get her involved.

12:23.180 --> 12:25.020
- Hand it in once you're done.
- Got it, Ms. He.

12:29.000 --> 12:30.340
Hi, Ms. He.

12:30.380 --> 12:32.300
Xiaoman, come here.

12:32.340 --> 12:33.920
Your leading the cheer squad

12:33.960 --> 12:35.240
is great today.

12:35.280 --> 12:36.540
That performance is outstanding.

12:37.320 --> 12:38.440
Thank you, Ms. He.

12:39.080 --> 12:40.440
I still have a lot to improve.

12:40.480 --> 12:41.800
Don't be so modest.

12:41.840 --> 12:43.560
You've got real leadership.

12:43.600 --> 12:44.900
Lin Qile knew little about dances

12:44.940 --> 12:45.840
but she performed well.

12:45.880 --> 12:48.040
Your coach kept praising both of you.

12:48.080 --> 12:49.960
You two really made the class proud.

12:52.700 --> 12:53.540
Ms. He,

12:54.180 --> 12:55.880
not just cheerleading,

12:55.920 --> 12:57.100
I'll keep working hard

12:57.140 --> 12:58.480
in my studies. I want to bring honor

12:58.520 --> 12:59.640
to our class both ways.

13:00.940 --> 13:01.900
Good girl.

13:01.940 --> 13:04.880
This whole cheer squad experience
brought you

13:04.920 --> 13:06.000
and Lin Qile closer.

13:06.520 --> 13:08.140
Help her more with school, okay?

13:08.180 --> 13:10.160
She's not dumb. She works hard.

13:10.200 --> 13:13.040
She just needs time to catch up.

13:13.080 --> 13:14.140
Try guiding her along.

13:14.180 --> 13:16.480
We can't let a kid like that

13:16.520 --> 13:18.480
actually get kicked out of Class 18.

13:25.560 --> 13:26.520
Don't worry, Ms. He.

13:27.940 --> 13:29.520
I'll make sure to help Lin Qile.

13:31.360 --> 13:32.860
- Goodbye, Ms. He.
- Take care.

13:55.000 --> 13:55.980
You were right.

13:56.020 --> 13:57.540
We should help Jiang Qiaoxi.

13:58.660 --> 13:59.820
Make sure he finds his way back.

14:00.720 --> 14:02.280
Okay, I'll call Auntie Liang now.

14:05.400 --> 14:06.240
No need.

14:08.340 --> 14:09.280
This

14:10.080 --> 14:11.800
isn't just about her knowing.

14:15.660 --> 14:17.580
Yu Qiao, why so quiet?

14:18.660 --> 14:19.500
Nothing.

14:20.220 --> 14:21.060
Why aren't you talking?

14:23.400 --> 14:25.560
Lin Yingtao and Jiang Qiaoxi
are way too much.

14:26.140 --> 14:27.760
They're off sneaking a meal.

14:29.260 --> 14:30.740
Like you haven't had jujube buns before.

14:31.320 --> 14:33.840
You've been training too much.
Your brain's gone mush.

14:34.580 --> 14:35.920
You seriously think

14:35.960 --> 14:37.780
they're just eating buns together?

14:38.280 --> 14:39.340
Obviously not.

14:40.220 --> 14:41.680
They also have stuffed lotus root.

14:44.020 --> 14:46.280
All those teen romance novels,
and that's all you've learned?

14:49.380 --> 14:50.540
Yu Qiao,

14:50.580 --> 14:51.740
didn't Feng Letian say

14:51.780 --> 14:53.940
he'd lend you Zhu Xian?

14:53.980 --> 14:55.660
Huang Zhanjie took it.

14:55.700 --> 14:57.280
Huang Zhanjie said you wouldn't care.

14:59.960 --> 15:00.960
I wouldn't care?

15:02.020 --> 15:03.380
Who told him that?

15:03.920 --> 15:04.760
Okay…

15:05.480 --> 15:07.280
Even if we tried getting it back,
no chance.

15:07.320 --> 15:09.420
He's at the Seven Sects Tournament part.

15:09.460 --> 15:11.420
It's intense. He won't put it down.

15:13.260 --> 15:14.100
Do I look that generous

15:14.740 --> 15:15.740
for he to just take it?

15:17.660 --> 15:19.340
What happened to taking turns?

15:23.020 --> 15:24.780
There's no such thing as fair turns.

15:24.820 --> 15:26.360
Things that are meant for yours

15:26.400 --> 15:28.260
will skip the lines and land in your lap.

15:28.920 --> 15:29.780
If it's not for you,

15:29.820 --> 15:31.120
you could fight all you want,

15:31.160 --> 15:32.060
and still lose out.

15:33.780 --> 15:34.900
Qin Yeyun,

15:34.940 --> 15:36.080
say that again.

15:36.120 --> 15:37.520
I'm writing that down for Feng Letian.

15:37.560 --> 15:38.560
He needs it in his novel.

15:43.820 --> 15:45.040
Out of the way.

15:45.080 --> 15:46.860
Look who's here. Jia Sisi and Hu Yan.

15:49.160 --> 15:51.260
Those two megaphones.
What are they doing here?

15:51.300 --> 15:53.160
Their mouths leak like colanders.

15:53.200 --> 15:54.080
Everything leaks out.

15:55.460 --> 15:56.860
If they catch wind of…

16:07.520 --> 16:08.360
You two.

16:08.400 --> 16:09.340
What are you doing here?

16:10.240 --> 16:12.040
What are you doing here?

16:12.640 --> 16:13.920
Come on, it's a basketball court.

16:13.960 --> 16:15.140
And you two?

16:15.180 --> 16:16.820
Off chasing some juicy gossip again?

16:16.860 --> 16:18.480
Just taking a stroll.

16:18.520 --> 16:19.800
Wandering, you know.

16:19.840 --> 16:21.100
Not just walking around.

16:21.140 --> 16:22.380
Yu Qiao,

16:22.420 --> 16:23.680
we heard what's going on.

16:23.720 --> 16:25.600
Jiang Qiaoxi and Lin Qile

16:25.640 --> 16:26.760
are alone there.

16:28.220 --> 16:29.180
Are you serious?

16:29.220 --> 16:30.200
Where did you hear that?

16:31.260 --> 16:32.200
That's not important.

16:32.240 --> 16:33.980
- Go play your basketball.
- Is that true?

16:34.020 --> 16:36.120
Who told you? Can you trust them?

16:36.160 --> 16:37.720
Can't say.

16:37.760 --> 16:38.980
But the information is solid.

16:39.020 --> 16:40.800
If you don't believe us,

16:40.840 --> 16:42.160
come see for yourself.

16:42.700 --> 16:43.540
Yu Qiao,

16:43.580 --> 16:44.980
I'd think twice.

16:45.660 --> 16:48.420
We're classmates. We don't want to
see you get hurt. Let's go.

16:51.600 --> 16:53.060
From here

16:53.100 --> 16:54.120
to the car,

16:54.700 --> 16:55.900
we've got maybe one minute left.

16:58.200 --> 16:59.820
What can we do for one minute?

17:20.560 --> 17:21.660
We're so silly.

17:21.700 --> 17:23.839
Why are we so hung up on a single minute?

17:25.579 --> 17:27.160
We were lucky today.

17:27.880 --> 17:30.100
I pulled off something huge.

17:31.000 --> 17:32.300
And we got to

17:32.980 --> 17:33.820
eat together.

17:34.440 --> 17:35.760
That should be enough.

17:35.800 --> 17:37.020
But it's not.

17:37.920 --> 17:38.980
Yingtao,

17:40.040 --> 17:41.220
don't settle either.

17:42.340 --> 17:43.500
We shouldn't stop here.

17:56.180 --> 17:57.020
Hello?

17:59.880 --> 18:00.720
What's wrong?

18:04.600 --> 18:05.680
Come here.

18:05.720 --> 18:06.560
Where are you going?

18:07.300 --> 18:08.140
What's going on?

18:08.180 --> 18:09.660
Jia Sisi, Hu Yan,

18:10.520 --> 18:11.480
you know

18:11.520 --> 18:12.540
why people

18:12.580 --> 18:13.800
love talking about others?

18:13.840 --> 18:15.200
What are you implying?

18:16.440 --> 18:17.680
Because

18:17.720 --> 18:19.920
when they talk about themselves,

18:19.960 --> 18:20.800
nobody listens.

18:21.880 --> 18:24.420
Yu Qiao, that was unexpectedly wise.

18:24.460 --> 18:25.440
Awesome.

18:25.480 --> 18:26.920
Feng Letian really missed out.

18:26.960 --> 18:28.720
He could've used that
for one of his novels.

18:28.760 --> 18:31.080
Yu Qiao, what's with the snide remarks?

18:31.120 --> 18:33.540
Why do you always talk
like you're throwing punches?

18:33.580 --> 18:34.840
If you're mad at someone else,

18:34.880 --> 18:36.020
don't take it out on us.

18:36.600 --> 18:38.820
Relax. I never said it was about you.

18:40.100 --> 18:41.800
Jia Sisi and Hu Yan are coming.

18:42.880 --> 18:43.720
Jia Sisi?

18:44.880 --> 18:45.900
Why climbing the wall?

18:46.460 --> 18:48.300
- Just trust me.
- Okay, let me help you up.

18:49.740 --> 18:50.580
Let's go.

18:51.620 --> 18:52.460
Jia Sisi,

18:53.100 --> 18:54.200
when will you release

18:54.240 --> 18:55.600
new chapter for your comic?

18:55.640 --> 18:57.420
What comic?

18:57.460 --> 18:59.540
The one like Boys Over Flowers,

18:59.580 --> 19:01.260
a bunch of boys chasing one girl.

19:01.300 --> 19:03.340
Sisi, you draw that stuff?

19:03.380 --> 19:05.380
How come you never told me?

19:05.420 --> 19:06.640
How do you know about that?

19:06.680 --> 19:07.580
Going through my stuff?

19:07.620 --> 19:08.900
Please, I'm not that bored.

19:09.420 --> 19:10.800
Wu Shuang from your old school

19:10.840 --> 19:13.040
is on my cheer squad.

19:13.080 --> 19:15.300
She let me read it after you showed her.

19:15.940 --> 19:17.400
We thought it was good.

19:17.440 --> 19:18.680
Interesting story.

19:18.720 --> 19:20.160
Really?

19:20.200 --> 19:21.440
I just

19:21.480 --> 19:22.800
doodled it for fun.

19:23.780 --> 19:24.620
Come on, hurry up.

19:25.140 --> 19:26.720
Careful. Get up there first.

19:28.040 --> 19:29.640
Hold on, I'll help you.

19:32.460 --> 19:33.300
It's really high.

19:33.860 --> 19:35.000
I'll go down first. Don't move.

19:35.040 --> 19:35.880
Okay.

19:38.180 --> 19:39.200
Even if it's just a doodle,

19:39.240 --> 19:40.840
it's still your story.

19:41.380 --> 19:42.860
Instead of chasing

19:42.900 --> 19:43.980
someone else's drama,

19:44.020 --> 19:45.240
maybe focus on your own.

19:45.280 --> 19:47.120
Your story is worth telling too.

19:47.740 --> 19:49.020
Alright.

19:49.060 --> 19:50.640
Hey, Qin Yeyun,

19:50.680 --> 19:51.600
you used to

19:51.640 --> 19:53.040
look down your nose at everyone.

19:53.080 --> 19:54.540
Since when did you get so good

19:54.580 --> 19:55.420
with words?

19:58.300 --> 19:59.140
I get it now.

19:59.700 --> 20:01.300
Sisi, don't listen to them.

20:01.340 --> 20:02.700
They're all from Qishan,

20:02.740 --> 20:04.240
all friends with Lin Qile.

20:04.280 --> 20:05.900
With how loud they're being,

20:05.940 --> 20:07.780
they're clearly stalling.

20:07.820 --> 20:08.660
Let's go.

20:10.160 --> 20:11.540
- Come on.
- I got you.

20:12.300 --> 20:13.260
Here.

20:13.800 --> 20:14.640
I'm fine.

20:16.960 --> 20:17.800
I can do it.

20:20.340 --> 20:21.180
Dog!

20:21.220 --> 20:22.060
Don't run!

20:22.100 --> 20:22.940
Jiang Qiaoxi!

20:22.980 --> 20:24.420
Stop! Put me down!

20:24.460 --> 20:25.300
Put me down!

20:30.100 --> 20:31.200
Stop running!

20:31.920 --> 20:33.100
Let's go down there.

20:43.620 --> 20:44.460
No one's here.

20:47.580 --> 20:48.420
No one.

20:52.280 --> 20:55.220
Stop chasing me! Please!

21:05.520 --> 21:06.860
You okay?

21:07.600 --> 21:08.580
Sorry. We're fine.

21:09.580 --> 21:10.420
Come on, get up.

21:10.460 --> 21:11.520
I'm fine.

21:11.560 --> 21:12.840
- Did you get hurt?
- You okay?

21:13.380 --> 21:14.660
No. You broke the fall.

21:17.540 --> 21:18.380
You're alright, yeah?

21:22.080 --> 21:23.000
What's wrong?

21:27.020 --> 21:29.620
Blood! You're bleeding!

21:29.660 --> 21:31.520
You're bleeding!

21:31.560 --> 21:32.760
You're bleeding!

21:35.400 --> 21:36.240
Yingtao!

21:37.060 --> 21:37.900
To the hospital.

21:51.540 --> 21:55.020
EMERGENCY TREATMENT

21:55.060 --> 21:59.800
EMERGENCY IMAGING OFFICE

22:17.220 --> 22:21.040
CT & X-RAY DEPT

22:24.580 --> 22:27.000
Yingtao, you're not back at school yet?

22:27.660 --> 22:30.700
Uncle, I'm really sorry.

22:30.740 --> 22:32.840
I didn't mean to cause all this trouble.

22:33.500 --> 22:35.880
- I'm really, really sorry.
- You've been apologizing nonstop.

22:36.860 --> 22:38.040
He's still being examined.

22:38.880 --> 22:40.180
Let's wait for the results.

22:41.160 --> 22:42.160
Zhang.

22:43.380 --> 22:44.220
Mr. Jiang.

22:47.040 --> 22:47.880
How's Qiaoxi?

22:47.920 --> 22:49.020
Still inside.

22:49.060 --> 22:50.700
- In the scan room?
- Yeah.

22:50.740 --> 22:51.940
- I'll go check.
- Alright.

22:54.000 --> 22:54.940
Yingtao?

22:55.500 --> 22:56.660
What are you doing here?

22:57.640 --> 22:58.680
Uncle Jiang,

22:58.720 --> 22:59.880
I…

23:01.100 --> 23:02.820
Jiang Qiaoxi, he…

23:03.360 --> 23:05.800
he got hit by a scooter

23:07.100 --> 23:08.800
trying to protect me.

23:13.220 --> 23:14.060
It's alright.

23:14.880 --> 23:15.960
Don't cry.

23:16.000 --> 23:16.840
I'm sorry.

23:19.420 --> 23:21.240
I'll go in and check on him. Don't worry.

23:58.260 --> 24:01.020
Let your passion burn bright.

24:01.060 --> 24:02.020
Let this strength

24:02.060 --> 24:03.300
carry you forward.

24:05.180 --> 24:07.880
Every lesson

24:07.920 --> 24:09.780
is a test of your limits.

24:09.820 --> 24:11.160
Yingtao.

24:12.820 --> 24:13.660
- How is he?
- Let youth

24:13.700 --> 24:16.600
bloom on the 30th.

24:16.640 --> 24:18.300
How is Jiang Qiaoxi? Is he alright?

24:18.340 --> 24:19.920
He's alright.

24:20.880 --> 24:22.760
Just lost a lot of blood. Needs stitches.

24:23.520 --> 24:24.920
Jia Sisi said

24:24.960 --> 24:27.480
Cen Xiaoman and Fei Lingge
told her and Hu Yan

24:27.520 --> 24:28.780
that you guys were in the alley.

24:31.140 --> 24:31.980
I figured.

24:36.140 --> 24:37.060
I'm going back to class.

24:38.080 --> 24:38.920
Yingtao.

24:41.120 --> 24:43.080
Cen Xiaoman is crying in class.

24:43.900 --> 24:45.380
Jiang Qiaoxi got hurt,

24:45.420 --> 24:46.660
and she's devastated.

24:46.700 --> 24:48.300
Thinks it's all because of you.

24:49.360 --> 24:50.420
Once you're back,

24:50.460 --> 24:53.140
if she and the other girls come at you…

25:00.920 --> 25:01.760
I'm not scared.

25:03.320 --> 25:04.160
Not of that.

25:04.760 --> 25:05.600
Not of them.

25:06.980 --> 25:08.000
They should be scared of me.

25:09.000 --> 25:10.020
Scared I'll come for them.

25:25.700 --> 25:27.200
What are you waiting for? Let's go.

25:31.780 --> 25:33.460
Your mom already got

25:33.500 --> 25:35.300
the scooter driver's number from Zhang.

25:37.020 --> 25:38.340
She knows exactly

25:39.200 --> 25:40.640
how and where

25:40.680 --> 25:41.660
the accident happened.

25:42.240 --> 25:43.380
She knows everything now.

25:45.640 --> 25:46.480
Qiaoxi,

25:48.100 --> 25:49.580
right now,

25:51.220 --> 25:52.220
you should focus on studies.

25:56.460 --> 25:57.740
Dad,

25:57.780 --> 25:59.740
how can you brush me off even now?

26:02.280 --> 26:03.140
Please help me.

26:05.320 --> 26:06.160
Or better yet…

26:08.440 --> 26:10.320
help this family for once.

26:10.360 --> 26:11.540
Mom said

26:13.060 --> 26:14.900
if I keep seeing Lin Yingtao,

26:15.820 --> 26:17.440
she'll transfer Uncle Lin
to a site in Fujian.

26:18.340 --> 26:19.180
Dad,

26:20.560 --> 26:22.920
you know better than anyone what it's like
for a whole family

26:23.680 --> 26:25.980
to end up in a place
where everything is unfamiliar.

26:31.180 --> 26:33.200
If she really goes through with it,

26:34.940 --> 26:35.940
I'll fight back.

26:38.040 --> 26:38.880
Fight back?

26:42.940 --> 26:44.020
How?

26:44.700 --> 26:46.040
I'll report her.

26:47.520 --> 26:48.500
Abuse of power.

26:53.620 --> 26:54.880
You're her son.

26:55.820 --> 26:57.460
Why does it have to get this far?

27:00.280 --> 27:01.860
Why?

27:03.840 --> 27:04.780
Dad,

27:04.820 --> 27:06.960
if it's come to this between me and Mom,

27:07.000 --> 27:09.100
don't you think
you have some responsibility?

27:09.920 --> 27:10.760
All these years,

27:11.580 --> 27:13.140
every time we fought,

27:13.180 --> 27:14.760
you disappeared like a ghost.

27:14.800 --> 27:16.240
Ignored her feelings.

27:16.280 --> 27:17.760
Ignored mine.

27:18.760 --> 27:20.060
Once she gained total control

27:20.100 --> 27:21.180
with victory over me,

27:21.220 --> 27:22.060
you'd step in

27:22.560 --> 27:23.880
with a few comments

27:23.920 --> 27:25.020
and words of comfort.

27:25.060 --> 27:26.080
Are you sure

27:26.120 --> 27:27.320
you're part of this family?

27:29.300 --> 27:30.140
All these years,

27:30.940 --> 27:32.740
you never stepped into the storm.

27:36.740 --> 27:37.760
The truth is,

27:38.400 --> 27:39.960
I've always been in the storm.

27:40.920 --> 27:42.300
And I never once got out.

27:43.160 --> 27:44.320
Yes.

27:44.360 --> 27:45.340
The storm you're in

27:45.380 --> 27:46.680
is the non-stopped debate

27:47.200 --> 27:49.580
between you two on who's fault it is
for the incident back than.

27:49.620 --> 27:50.820
But what about now?

27:51.780 --> 27:53.000
I'm your kid too.

27:53.660 --> 27:55.380
You're not some neutral bystander.

27:56.820 --> 27:57.960
Do you really believe…

27:58.860 --> 28:00.940
Do you really believe
what she's done to me is okay?

28:03.780 --> 28:05.080
If it's not,

28:05.120 --> 28:06.200
then step up.

28:06.840 --> 28:07.680
Say something.

28:08.880 --> 28:09.960
Do something.

28:10.800 --> 28:11.840
Even just this once.

28:14.340 --> 28:15.340
Cen Xiaoman

28:15.380 --> 28:17.080
just got off the phone
with Jiang Qiaoxi's mom.

28:17.120 --> 28:18.040
You think she made it up?

28:18.560 --> 28:20.120
His mom said it herself

28:20.160 --> 28:21.580
he needed stitches.

28:22.080 --> 28:22.920
She was livid.

28:22.960 --> 28:24.020
Seriously?

28:24.060 --> 28:26.100
Is Jiang Qiaoxi trying
to throw his life away?

29:01.900 --> 29:02.740
Lin Qile,

29:03.460 --> 29:05.300
what did you do to Jiang Qiaoxi?

29:13.020 --> 29:14.060
Qiaoxi.

29:15.360 --> 29:16.200
Son.

29:18.700 --> 29:20.900
Just tell me what you want.

29:23.600 --> 29:25.220
Why should I tell you

29:25.860 --> 29:27.900
what I did to Jiang Qiaoxi?

29:30.280 --> 29:31.520
But I can tell you

29:32.780 --> 29:34.600
what I am about to do to Jiang Qiaoxi.

29:36.820 --> 29:37.960
I'm going to be good friends

29:39.680 --> 29:40.580
with Jiang Qiaoxi.

29:41.120 --> 29:42.180
I want to be good friend

29:44.440 --> 29:45.980
with Lin Yingtao, open and aboveboard.

29:46.540 --> 29:47.660
At school,

29:48.580 --> 29:49.420
I'll eat with him

29:50.000 --> 29:52.080
and the friends I choose.

29:52.620 --> 29:53.780
We walk to class together.

29:53.820 --> 29:54.940
We go home together.

29:54.980 --> 29:56.360
Either by bus…

29:56.900 --> 29:57.980
…or by bike.

30:00.540 --> 30:01.880
And on weekends, if we have time…

30:01.920 --> 30:03.000
We'll go hiking.

30:05.220 --> 30:07.020
- Just like we used to.
- Just like we used to.

30:28.980 --> 30:31.060
Judging by the way she talks,

30:31.100 --> 30:32.360
Jiang Qiaoxi and Lin Qile

30:32.400 --> 30:33.480
must be really close.

30:33.520 --> 30:34.740
Looks like it.

30:34.780 --> 30:36.940
Jiang Qiaoxi got hurt, sure.

30:36.980 --> 30:39.100
But he didn't seem to mind.

30:39.680 --> 30:41.120
Exactly.

30:44.620 --> 30:45.520
Lin Qile,

30:46.140 --> 30:48.300
do you even know
how much his mom hates you?

30:48.340 --> 30:49.540
Yeah, I know.

30:50.980 --> 30:52.320
But Jiang Qiaoxi doesn't.

30:53.420 --> 30:54.900
I'm not trying to be friends with her.

30:55.540 --> 30:57.460
You two aren't even in the same world.

30:59.340 --> 31:00.340
Think whatever you want.

31:01.360 --> 31:02.580
But just so you know,

31:03.920 --> 31:04.900
your gossip

31:05.980 --> 31:07.540
can't touch us anymore.

31:35.080 --> 31:36.100
I really think

31:37.680 --> 31:38.880
she's about to grow wings.

31:40.060 --> 31:41.360
Says from the book.

31:41.400 --> 31:42.520
If you try hard enough,

31:42.560 --> 31:44.000
if you jump far enough,

31:44.040 --> 31:45.420
wings will grow on your back.

31:46.180 --> 31:47.160
And then…

32:13.020 --> 32:13.860
Let me see.

32:14.940 --> 32:16.440
The scan results are back.

32:16.480 --> 32:17.660
No bleeding inside the skull.

32:17.700 --> 32:19.300
Just a surface wound. Nothing major.

32:24.180 --> 32:25.300
Does it hurt?

32:26.800 --> 32:27.640
Not really.

32:38.420 --> 32:39.820
You bled a lot

32:39.860 --> 32:40.700
and needed stitches.

32:41.280 --> 32:42.120
Of course it hurts.

32:43.940 --> 32:44.960
You kids forget pain

32:45.460 --> 32:46.420
as soon as it's gone.

32:46.460 --> 32:48.740
But mothers never forget.
It stays with us forever.

32:51.380 --> 32:52.340
Do you understand?

32:57.240 --> 32:58.080
Take your meds.

33:08.160 --> 33:09.440
The restrictions say

33:09.480 --> 33:11.360
no fava beans, no fish,

33:11.400 --> 33:12.880
nothing sour or cold for a day.

33:13.420 --> 33:15.560
I know. The doctor already told me.

33:17.940 --> 33:19.360
Then remember

33:20.320 --> 33:21.760
restrictions are there to protect you.

33:22.420 --> 33:23.700
Or you'll end up

33:23.740 --> 33:25.520
with more than just a busted head.

33:28.400 --> 33:29.720
This is nothing.

33:29.760 --> 33:30.740
I'm fine.

33:33.400 --> 33:34.540
I'm heading back to my room.

33:36.720 --> 33:38.020
You're fine?

33:42.520 --> 33:44.720
Then go pay the hospital bill.

33:44.760 --> 33:45.980
You know what I'm talking about.

33:46.020 --> 33:47.100
You are clearly aware.

33:51.460 --> 33:53.260
Mom, you think I can't handle it?

33:57.500 --> 33:59.020
I'm worried that you can't.

34:00.080 --> 34:00.940
Let me tell you, Mom,

34:01.880 --> 34:03.600
- if you do anything to the Lin…
- Liang Hongfei.

34:04.440 --> 34:05.520
Look,

34:05.560 --> 34:07.340
if you go after the Lin family,

34:07.380 --> 34:08.239
I'll report you.

34:10.060 --> 34:11.480
Abuse of power.

34:14.860 --> 34:15.699
Jiang Zheng,

34:17.260 --> 34:19.460
you've really grown
into your leadership role.

34:20.460 --> 34:22.500
As a father though?
You've only gone backwards.

34:23.460 --> 34:24.860
You failed to protect my Mengchu.

34:24.900 --> 34:26.400
Now you're going to let Jiang Qiaoxi

34:26.440 --> 34:27.840
crash and burn?

34:30.520 --> 34:32.080
I don't want to dig up the past.

34:34.540 --> 34:35.880
Right now, he just wants

34:35.920 --> 34:37.159
to hang out with his friends,

34:37.199 --> 34:38.199
to have a normal life.

34:38.239 --> 34:39.380
But in your mouth, it sounds

34:39.420 --> 34:40.760
like he's throwing his life away.

34:40.800 --> 34:41.840
What friends?

34:42.760 --> 34:45.520
Back when he was little,
he jumped off that ledge for her,

34:45.560 --> 34:46.620
then limped

34:46.659 --> 34:48.139
all the way back to Qunshan.

34:48.179 --> 34:49.480
Now he's bleeding again

34:49.520 --> 34:51.219
because of her.

34:51.260 --> 34:53.560
What happens next?
You even thought about it?

34:53.600 --> 34:55.120
She's not a friend.

34:55.159 --> 34:56.300
She's a walking disaster.

34:56.920 --> 34:57.940
Liang Hongfei.

34:58.520 --> 35:00.660
He ended up like this
because you pushed him too far.

35:01.300 --> 35:02.560
If we're talking about disasters,

35:02.600 --> 35:04.060
it's you and me. We're the problem.

35:04.100 --> 35:06.180
You don't deserve
to be the father of my kids.

35:30.300 --> 35:32.720
If you and your dad
aren't willing to send the Lins away,

35:34.000 --> 35:35.000
then I'll send you

35:35.560 --> 35:37.100
to an international school

35:37.140 --> 35:37.980
far away.

35:38.020 --> 35:40.360
I'll go with you. We'll move.

35:44.640 --> 35:47.540
I know getting me into a new school
is easy for you.

35:52.580 --> 35:53.500
But

35:54.960 --> 35:56.540
the Olympiad winter camp
is about to start.

35:58.060 --> 35:59.660
If I transfer now,

35:59.700 --> 36:01.440
it might mess with my studies.

36:07.300 --> 36:08.860
Do you even realize what you're saying?

36:11.580 --> 36:13.820
You're saying that for a girl?

36:15.860 --> 36:17.420
You were chosen for Olympiad math.

36:17.460 --> 36:18.780
No matter what happens,

36:19.720 --> 36:22.540
your choice should
always be math, not her.

36:22.580 --> 36:24.060
This isn't about choosing her.

36:27.020 --> 36:28.120
If I had to choose,

36:29.240 --> 36:30.620
I'd still choose myself.

36:31.760 --> 36:33.140
My life. What I want.

36:54.440 --> 36:55.480
And why do you

36:55.520 --> 36:57.820
get to choose so freely,

36:59.020 --> 36:59.940
but I don't?

37:01.460 --> 37:02.380
What about my life?

37:10.620 --> 37:11.460
Mom…

37:14.700 --> 37:15.700
Why does your life

37:18.080 --> 37:19.340
have to be built on mine?

37:28.120 --> 37:28.960
I'm sorry, Mom.

37:31.280 --> 37:32.460
But I'm going to

37:34.180 --> 37:35.560
win that trophy for Jiang Mengchu.

37:37.460 --> 37:39.080
Can I study now?

37:44.040 --> 37:46.140
So now you're using your brother
to push me?

37:50.260 --> 37:51.260
No.

37:54.460 --> 37:56.400
It is you who used him to push me

37:58.800 --> 37:59.780
this whole time.

38:25.320 --> 38:28.220
- Mrs. Liang, have some water.
- No need.

38:30.280 --> 38:31.800
I came without warning

38:31.840 --> 38:32.940
and I'm sorry to disturb you.

38:34.280 --> 38:35.700
But as a mother,

38:36.700 --> 38:37.820
I hope you can understand.

38:39.200 --> 38:40.840
Did something happen, Mrs. Liang?

38:42.300 --> 38:43.660
I was in a meeting this afternoon

38:44.520 --> 38:45.700
when my driver called.

38:46.820 --> 38:48.500
Jiang Qiaoxi got hit by a scooter.

38:48.540 --> 38:50.220
He hit his head.

38:50.260 --> 38:51.600
Got several stitches.

38:57.080 --> 38:58.580
Is Qiaoxi okay now?

39:01.420 --> 39:02.300
Yingtao.

39:03.840 --> 39:06.620
I heard you were with him
when it happened.

39:08.640 --> 39:09.660
As his mother,

39:10.220 --> 39:11.760
with his injuries,

39:12.720 --> 39:13.700
I think I deserve to know

39:14.220 --> 39:15.720
what really happened.

39:20.260 --> 39:22.480
Yingtao, just tell us.

39:22.520 --> 39:24.820
Let us know

39:24.860 --> 39:26.180
what happened exactly.

39:31.080 --> 39:32.120
I'm sorry, Auntie Liang.

39:33.420 --> 39:35.920
Jiang Qiaoxi got hurt
trying to protect me.

39:35.960 --> 39:37.160
Yingtao.

39:38.560 --> 39:40.280
Mrs. Liang, we're truly sorry.

39:40.920 --> 39:43.140
We'll cover the medical expenses.

39:43.180 --> 39:46.140
If there's anything else we need to do…

39:46.180 --> 39:47.700
It's not about the money.

39:49.960 --> 39:52.200
I just want to understand
the whole situation.

39:55.240 --> 39:56.420
Yingtao,

39:56.460 --> 39:57.480
my driver was supposed to

39:57.520 --> 39:59.240
take Qiaoxi to Olympiad training camp

39:59.280 --> 40:00.460
this afternoon.

40:01.460 --> 40:02.980
Why was he with you instead?

40:03.020 --> 40:04.400
Why did he get hurt protecting you?

40:08.680 --> 40:09.660
Say something.

40:10.900 --> 40:12.620
We were in an alley.

40:13.800 --> 40:14.920
I brought him food.

40:16.220 --> 40:17.560
Some classmates were about to come,

40:17.600 --> 40:18.560
so we hid.

40:19.500 --> 40:20.800
That's when the accident happened.

40:21.800 --> 40:24.200
Why were you hiding from them?

40:24.240 --> 40:27.180
- Didn't want them to get the wrong idea.
- What kind of idea?

40:29.320 --> 40:30.160
Auntie Liang,

40:30.880 --> 40:31.800
Jiang Qiaoxi and I

40:31.840 --> 40:33.620
weren't doing anything wrong.

40:33.660 --> 40:34.940
We're just friends.

40:36.180 --> 40:37.020
Yingtao,

40:38.720 --> 40:39.720
relax.

40:40.440 --> 40:41.940
I'm not blaming you.

40:41.980 --> 40:44.220
You're still young. You don't know better.

40:48.540 --> 40:49.380
Shengjuan,

40:51.420 --> 40:53.560
last time things got messy.

40:55.100 --> 40:55.940
And now

40:56.700 --> 40:57.840
another accident?

40:58.920 --> 40:59.800
Mrs. Liang,

40:59.840 --> 41:01.560
I'm sorry we caused trouble.

41:07.680 --> 41:09.600
I'm not worried about Jiang Qiaoxi.

41:11.920 --> 41:13.280
He's a boy.

41:13.320 --> 41:14.780
At school,

41:14.820 --> 41:16.500
he is popular with the girls.

41:16.540 --> 41:17.780
I get that Yingtao might want

41:18.940 --> 41:20.080
to spend time with him.

41:21.400 --> 41:23.360
But she's a girl.

41:24.100 --> 41:25.620
And I don't want people talking about her

41:27.020 --> 41:29.260
behind her back just because of him.

41:29.300 --> 41:30.900
Auntie Liang,

41:30.940 --> 41:32.380
it has nothing to do with gender.

41:32.920 --> 41:34.780
And me being friends with him has nothing

41:34.820 --> 41:36.300
to do with how popular he is.

41:36.340 --> 41:37.440
Yingtao.

41:40.340 --> 41:42.580
She's a bit too blunt.

41:44.280 --> 41:45.300
Kids are kids.

41:46.840 --> 41:47.680
It's fine.

41:51.760 --> 41:52.720
I'll head out now.

41:55.120 --> 41:56.760
Sorry again, Mrs. Liang.

42:04.840 --> 42:05.680
Shengjuan…

42:07.880 --> 42:08.940
They're still young.

42:09.860 --> 42:11.000
They don't know the boundaries.

42:12.460 --> 42:13.840
But as parents,

42:14.540 --> 42:16.240
we need to help them see it.

42:18.560 --> 42:20.600
Otherwise all the gossip

42:21.580 --> 42:23.560
won't just land on them.

42:24.360 --> 42:25.760
It'll land on us too.

42:26.960 --> 42:28.400
Sound fine

42:29.120 --> 42:30.540
if it was called spoiling.

42:32.840 --> 42:33.940
But instigation

42:37.100 --> 42:38.140
is another.

42:39.700 --> 42:40.960
Take care, Mrs. Liang.

42:42.840 --> 42:44.560
She can't talk down
to you and Dad like that.

42:46.020 --> 42:46.860
It's fine.

42:47.580 --> 42:48.860
Qiaoxi got hurt,

42:49.520 --> 42:50.760
and she just panicked.

42:50.800 --> 42:52.260
That's why she said those things.

45:11.500 --> 45:15.200
Subtitle translation by: Jiaxin Wang
